ands like ben nye  and cinema secrets use acrylate / octal  acrylamide copolymer while the very  popular green marble spray uses acrylic  resins  [Music]  a lot of the polymers used in fixing  sprays are also used in hair spray and  so if you don't have a makeup setting  spray handy then hair spray can work as  well although probably won't work quite  as well as a product that's purposely  designed for your face  generally hair spray isn't designed to  have the same flex as a spray for your  face because your hair doesn't move as  much as your face and they shouldn't  have more alcohol so they were a bit  more dehydrating but it's a popular  trick that's used in theater and drag  for giving a heavier film that looks  good even if you have hot stage lights  [Music]  now you might think that the second type  of sprayed the type that doesn't fix  your makeup is less effective and less  useful but it really depends on what  you're looking for the second type is  still really useful but for a different  purpose they're really good for  moisturizing your skin after you've  applied makeup and so for example if in  the middle of the day your skin gets  really dry and flaky it has a fine  enough mist that you won't disturb your  makeup and you can still get the  moisture into your skin there are loads  and loads of sprays in this category so  for example from al genus glam glow  Innisfree Mac Marc Jacobs pixie marabou  - ooh you can also make this type of  setting spray yourself with your  favorite bunny who met Cantona just make  sure you put it into a spray bottle that  has a fine enough spray that your makeup  doesn't run  [Music]  you use both of these makeup setting  sprays in the same way after you apply  your makeup including the powder you  hold them at an arm's length away and  spray them across your face a few times  most phones recommend drawing an X or a  chi across your face with them I  personally tend to spray its stripes  down my face and then add extra around  my nose for the skincare type spray so  you can also use them under your makeup  if I'm using mascara I apply it before I  put on the mascara otherwise I tend to  end up with mascara smudges under my  eyes if I close them too hard also  definitely close your eyes when you  spray them on your face don't be like me  and take a deep breath before spray them  otherwise you might end up hacking up a  lung like some idiot I know who is  definitely not me and so that's all for  me today if you're a fan of beauty  science please subscribe to my channel  you can also follow me on my blog  Instagram and Facebook and hopefully  that will fill all your beauty science  needs if you have any topics suggestions  feel free to leave them in the comments  and I'll see you next time  you
 

